001100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
001200 PROGRAM-ID.    TBLKBYCD.
001300 AUTHOR.        BARBARA WINTER.
001400 DATE-WRITTEN.  7/25/83.
001500 DATE-COMPILED.
001600*REMARKS.    REPORT OF REQUIREMENT ORDERS BY CORPORATE CODE.
001700***************************************************************
001800*                     T B L K B Y C D                         *
001900*     THIS PRINT REPORT IS CALLED FROM XRSCREEN.OBJECT AND    *
002000*  PRINTS ALL CODES THAT ARE TIED TO A REQUIREMENT ORDER.     *
002100*  OPTIONS INCLUDE A LOW AND HIGH RANGE OF CORPORATE CODES TO *
002200*  USE, AND A FLAG INDICATING WHETHER TO PRINT ALL CODES      *
002300*  WITHIN THAT RANGE OR JUST THE CODES TIED TO A REQUIREMENT  *
002400*  ORDER.  IF ALL CODES ARE INDICATED, THE USAGE AND CODE     *
002500*  DESCRIPTION IS PRINTED AND THE PO INFORMATION IS FILLED IN *
002600*  WITH ASTERICKS.  THE PRINTOUT IS SORTED BY CODE AND THEN   *
002700*  PO EXPIRATION DATE WITHIN A CODE.  ENDING TOTALS ARE SHOWN *
002800*  FOR THE NUMBER OF CODES THAT WERE WITHIN THE RANGE AND THE *
002900*  NUMBER OF CODES PRINTED ON THE REPORT.                     *
003000***************************************************************
003100
      *C
      *C 06/22/92  BK DISMUKES  REQUEST 5733
      *C      1. ADDED LOGIC TO SELECT BY BUYER CODE.
      *C      2. CHANGED SCREEN FBLKBYCD/ZRSCREEN TO ALLOW INPUT
      *C         OF SELECTED BUYER CODE.
      *C
      *C 07/23/96  CA YODER
      *C   MODIFIED FOR CENTURY DATABASE CHANGES.
      *C
      *C  11/25/97    JEFF BUNGO   REQ #97-017
      *C     ADD USAGE FIELDS FOR DIRECT DELIVERY.  DD USAGE
      *C     TO BE STORED IN ADDITIONAL FIELD AND TOTAL USAGE.
      *C     STORE ISSUE USAGE CALCULATED BY TOTAL USAGE - DD USAGE.
      *C
003200 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
